  "modified": "2026-08-06T09:13:19Z",
  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: integer overflow in the TIM image reader\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-66628.patch: guard the image_size\n       computation with HeapOverflowSanityCheckGetSize() and reject files\n       claiming more data than the blob holds in ReadTIMImage() in\n       coders/tim.c\n     - CVE-2025-66628\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: infinite loop in the PCD decoder on a missing Sync\n     marker\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-24485.patch: track the ReadBlob return in\n       byte_count and bail out on a short read in the PCDGetBits macro, and\n       guard the sync-search and delta-recovery loops with EOFBlob() so a\n       truncated PCD terminates with a corrupt-image warning instead of\n       looping, in DecodeImage() in coders/pcd.c\n     - CVE-2026-24485\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: off-by-one boundary check in the double-to-integer\n     cast helper\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-25989.patch: tighten the MAGICK_SSIZE_MAX\n       guard from > to >= in CastDoubleToLong() in magick/image-private.h\n     - CVE-2026-25989",
